        dcterms:description "Every computational section and docstring in `2008-metzger-lung-stereotyped-branching.py` maps explicitly to Metzger et al. (2008) Figs. 1-4, Menshykau et al. (2012, 2014) Eqs. 1-5, and the 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_053_lung_stereotyped_branching_modes.lean` (L1-35, L102-465)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
